# Local dev data -- production data lives entirely in the
# sourcedcs-web-data Docker volume, mounted at /app/data. This directory
# is gitignored runtime data (pilot-registry.json, applications.json, roster.json, ...);
# baking it into the image would ship it in every pushed GHCR layer regardless of the
# volume mount masking it at runtime. First-boot defaults live in data-seed/, which DOES ship.
